- Footer brand link: `aria-label="Trafigura Foundation home"`
- Do not put conflicting `role="list"` on Swiper wrappers

### 5. SEO / IA context (not always in theme files)

Public hubs (index): `/content-hub/` · `/partners-stories/` · `/areas-of-work/`  
Hidden CPT archives: `/news/` · `/partner-stories/` · `/area-of-work/` → noindex and/or 301 to hubs  

Trackers live in `SEO/` (`yoast-meta-all-pages.csv`, `news-to-partner-links.csv`, `CHECKLIST-big-wins.md`, `WEEK1-step-by-step.md`) — do not delete on theme replace.

