## Quick verify after sync

1. Grep query templates for `"order" => "ASC"` on news/partner-stories → fix to DESC  
2. View-source homepage: WebP poster preload present; no hero `<source src=` until desktop JS; Euclid medium preload  
3. Content Hub H1 = `Content Hub`  
4. Home pillars + Content Hub/Partners headings are links  
5. `home-hero-poster-960.webp` (+ jpg) exists under `assets/images/`  
6. Head templates include deferred GTM partial (not blocking snippet)  
7. Euclid + Bebas `@font-face` local `.woff2`, `font-display: optional`; no `fonts.googleapis.com` / `fonts.gstatic.com`  
8. News/partner card imgs use `trafigura_card_image()`; `assets/images/optimized/` present  
9. No cdnjs / jsDelivr / unpkg / Netlify script URLs in footers  
10. `header.php` includes `rem-root` before other head output  
11. `.navbar` default `width: 0` (not a permanent 272rem column); 1752px rule still forces open sidebar  
12. Partner singles: areas tag present in HTML with `hidden` / `is--areas-of-work`  
13. Purge W3TC after deploy  

## Known anti-patterns (do not reintroduce)

- Deferring homepage GSAP/Swiper until `load` + idle → blank filmstrip, LCP ~5–6s  
- Removing `jquery-migrate` → Webflow staging regressions  
- `.main-wrapper { opacity: 0 }` until JS  
- `animation="loading"` on homepage H1  
- Blocking GTM / Google Fonts / Elementor Roboto in `<head>`  
- `min-width: 272rem` on closed navbar / `scrollbar-gutter` experiments that fight intended nav UX  
- Hero layout “in-flow aspect-ratio” experiments that hurt mobile scores — keep absolute hero wrapper as designed unless carefully retested  
